# Drop one proxy per line. Supported formats:
#
#   http://user:pass@host:port
#   host:port:user:pass
#   host:port
#   DIRECT          (uses your local IP — NOT recommended for Amazon)
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Blank lines are ignored.
# Copy this file to "proxies.txt" and add your real proxies.

# Examples (these are fake — replace with your own):
# http://user:pass@1.2.3.4:8080
# 5.6.7.8:8080:user:pass
# 9.10.11.12:3128
